{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0009333496.wav", "text": "It doesn't make any sense that it would disappear like that.", "duration": 2.859}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0009818010.wav", "text": "We left eight all by herself.", "duration": 2.304}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0020606401.wav", "text": "A quick scan shows all my systems are operating normally.", "duration": 3.285}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0031983636.wav", "text": "Uh, Hugh? Is your headset broken?", "duration": 2.923}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0036579581.wav", "text": "Let's play hide-and-seek again. You won't find me this time.", "duration": 3.904}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0037332296.wav", "text": "It's pretty fun talking like this.", "duration": 3.392}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0039705223.wav", "text": "But what if there's something worse than getting hurt?", "duration": 2.731}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0048428988.wav", "text": "It's a really cool machine that lets you do training simulations!", "duration": 3.669}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0051000474.wav", "text": "Toys? I've never had toys before.", "duration": 3.307}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0051621225.wav", "text": "Look, I got good, right?", "duration": 2.176}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0053708759.wav", "text": "I think so. I didn't see any other bots or humans.", "duration": 3.541}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0055168359.wav", "text": "The mannequins we saw had a lot of different kinds of outfits.", "duration": 4.011}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0058155574.wav", "text": "Or maybe I just wasn't good enough.", "duration": 2.176}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0066980577.wav", "text": "You're pretty different from all the other grown-ups I've met.", "duration": 2.795}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0072339889.wav", "text": "I may not remember anything before the vault, but this has to be the most fun I've ever had.", "duration": 5.269}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0077155459.wav", "text": "If you want a bigger Pragmata, it would be more efficient to start from scratch.", "duration": 4.437}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0092150023.wav", "text": "I'm okay. All the bots on the cradle have been made to withstand the moon's environment.", "duration": 4.203}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0092631354.wav", "text": "And, like, I've always had this function that lets me manipulate data transmissions.", "duration": 4.629}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0098460259.wav", "text": "Oh, Hugh? Remember when I said you're useful?", "duration": 3.648}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0098477992.wav", "text": "Do you think eight's okay? Must be hard controlling that much dead filament.", "duration": 4.821}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0100539940.wav", "text": "Hugh, have you ever lived in New York?", "duration": 2.197}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0106660120.wav", "text": "I'll be able to help you even more than before!", "duration": 2.304}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0107952976.wav", "text": "Aww, I was sure you wouldn't find me there.", "duration": 3.477}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0109990024.wav", "text": "Because of you, I've had so much fun and learned new things.", "duration": 4.203}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0110735882.wav", "text": "Maybe Edus is using it to make more bots.", "duration": 2.517}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0113598157.wav", "text": "Maybe it's the same for replicators.", "duration": 2.091}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0118600073.wav", "text": "Ten, nine, eight, seven, six.", "duration": 5.035}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0120044213.wav", "text": "No, it's me wearing pretty clothes. I want to wear something like this one day.", "duration": 5.824}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0124542596.wav", "text": "Hm? Didn't you say before that you don't like kids?", "duration": 4.203}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0137699821.wav", "text": "And I wanted to give this to you so you'd remember.", "duration": 2.645}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0138409145.wav", "text": "Alright. You gotta be careful too, okay?", "duration": 3.413}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0140453686.wav", "text": "Hugh, can I go outside to play some time?", "duration": 2.603}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0143210117.wav", "text": "Air Raiders really zoom around fast, huh?", "duration": 3.072}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0156627506.wav", "text": "Let's finish our game of hide and seek from earlier. You better find me this time.", "duration": 5.312}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0157532068.wav", "text": "Yay, it's so cute!", "duration": 2.261}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0160253719.wav", "text": "It gets kind of bumpy riding on your back, though. It's hard to hold on sometimes.", "duration": 4.544}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0161823896.wav", "text": "Well, let's try our best, Q.", "duration": 2.069}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0165044535.wav", "text": "You can learn more about the Cradle's bots with this.", "duration": 2.56}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0169101871.wav", "text": "Everything we need is already at the cradle. So why do we need Earth stuff?", "duration": 3.989}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0170732915.wav", "text": "Kids sound kind of weird.", "duration": 3.435}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0173811499.wav", "text": "Getting nutrients from talking? That's so weird.", "duration": 4.096}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0178053861.wav", "text": "Hugh, is something wrong?", "duration": 2.667}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0194578384.wav", "text": "Why was every mannequin wearing something different?", "duration": 2.795}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0206814035.wav", "text": "Hey, Hugh, how are humans and bots different?", "duration": 4.928}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0210176717.wav", "text": "Um, I'm not sure. I don't remember.", "duration": 4.309}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0214734259.wav", "text": "Mm-hmm. But we'll need to find the right mats.", "duration": 3.093}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0218909709.wav", "text": "You won't find me next time. I'll pick a super hard spot.", "duration": 4.096}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0222653025.wav", "text": "No! You're doing great! And you're really, really useful!", "duration": 4.352}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0226097762.wav", "text": "I think the Luna Diggers made that too.", "duration": 2.432}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0230380776.wav", "text": "That lunadigger came out of nowhere!", "duration": 2.24}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0240692514.wav", "text": "Hmm. Q? Does this bring back memories?", "duration": 4.075}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0241083811.wav", "text": "Mmm, that might have been something Edith made on its own.", "duration": 3.115}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0241493505.wav", "text": "Hey, then let's play later, okay?", "duration": 2.539}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0243259230.wav", "text": "Well, what do you think would look good?", "duration": 2.197}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0249469186.wav", "text": "I don't feel it like humans do, but my system will assign it a numerical value.", "duration": 5.909}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0255412879.wav", "text": "Oh yeah, I have a question about that globe.", "duration": 2.88}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0262363658.wav", "text": "The eight I knew wouldn't do that.", "duration": 2.155}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0263600664.wav", "text": "Earth has tons of stuff like this, right?", "duration": 2.475}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0268163955.wav", "text": "Lonely? I don't know about that, but it was pretty boring.", "duration": 6.443}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0269506593.wav", "text": "Let's find something that suits you better.", "duration": 3.712}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0274864461.wav", "text": "I kinda want you to find me, but I kinda don't.", "duration": 2.965}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0275185778.wav", "text": "Plus, if I flew away, we wouldn't be able to talk. That'd be bad.", "duration": 5.077}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0276443592.wav", "text": "Oh, oh, I just thought of the perfect hiding place. You're never going to find me.", "duration": 5.12}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0278456783.wav", "text": "New York was so big. I liked all the sparkly things.", "duration": 5.355}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0290032677.wav", "text": "Do you think she's okay? She sounded in trouble.", "duration": 3.477}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0292783870.wav", "text": "I'm not some AI bot. I'm a state-of-the-art pragma-", "duration": 4.8}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0299391589.wav", "text": "Five, four, three, two, one.", "duration": 5.056}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0300191237.wav", "text": "Why did you thank Edith for the warm welcome?", "duration": 2.901}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0300844253.wav", "text": "I was designed to experience human feelings and sensations like you do.", "duration": 4.053}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0302425205.wav", "text": "There's all these lines all over it. Isn't that annoying for the people who live there?", "duration": 5.141}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0328986832.wav", "text": "Hugh, if you were doing something dangerous, would you want someone to stop you?", "duration": 3.925}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0329448753.wav", "text": "I can't wait to see a real ocean. Let's go to Earth soon, okay?", "duration": 5.611}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0330625487.wav", "text": "Thanks for always keeping me company and talking to me.", "duration": 2.987}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0334284616.wav", "text": "Terminal Hunting Pro?", "duration": 2.539}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0334553730.wav", "text": "The Pterodome is amazing!", "duration": 2.304}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0336026240.wav", "text": "But you're always like, what the hell is this? So I thought you'd be interested.", "duration": 5.184}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0336669060.wav", "text": "This outfit is kind of me right now.", "duration": 3.307}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0340227390.wav", "text": "That replicator was broken. We gotta fix it.", "duration": 2.837}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0345372228.wav", "text": "Um, hey, so, uh...", "duration": 4.053}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0346050612.wav", "text": "They have a name, you know. It's Cabin!", "duration": 3.285}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0347910405.wav", "text": "I drew lots, but this one turned out the best.", "duration": 3.136}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0353987897.wav", "text": "Then one day, I just tried it out. Pretty cool, huh?", "duration": 4.139}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0362387399.wav", "text": "Thanks, Hugh. I'll do my best.", "duration": 2.709}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0362686859.wav", "text": "Hmm. I wonder if R.E.M.'s will make me feel better, too.", "duration": 4.608}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0365704723.wav", "text": "No, it's not. Cats walking on the moon would be cute.", "duration": 4.437}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0366552059.wav", "text": "Hmm. There's something odd on this terminal.", "duration": 3.072}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0368094487.wav", "text": "Also, my body was made with special components, so fixing me isn't easy.", "duration": 4.651}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0371265693.wav", "text": "The more living stuff dead filament eats, the bigger it gets.", "duration": 4.011}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0373251010.wav", "text": "I know I wasn't of much use, but I really wanted to help her.", "duration": 4.437}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0376645120.wav", "text": "And Earth's covered in living things.", "duration": 2.517}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0380117668.wav", "text": "Phew! Let's play hide-and-seek. Ready or not, here we go!", "duration": 4.203}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0386081165.wav", "text": "Hugh, what kind of clothes do you like? Is your suit your favorite?", "duration": 5.013}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0387118101.wav", "text": "Pterodome trees are so cool! They can grow really fast!", "duration": 4.267}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0388085821.wav", "text": "Even if Nicholas is gone, I'll still be here for you. I'll try my best to surpass his efficiency.", "duration": 6.869}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0393082055.wav", "text": "Yeah, it's the best. We've seen all kinds of nature.", "duration": 3.947}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0393264855.wav", "text": "but they probably don't want to walk around here.", "duration": 2.581}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0394921180.wav", "text": "Lunadiggers are really scary. They get all tense when they pop out.", "duration": 4.587}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0397186865.wav", "text": "Come on, let's do something.", "duration": 2.325}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0400158518.wav", "text": "Did you see? The branches just grew in from nowhere!", "duration": 3.541}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0403137242.wav", "text": "Fine. Don't worry about me.", "duration": 2.816}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0407282938.wav", "text": "What goodies did we bring back this time?", "duration": 2.197}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0414909150.wav", "text": "If so, let's pretend we're cats. I'll be a cute striped one and...", "duration": 4.437}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0415056878.wav", "text": "No, Edus only manages the bots.", "duration": 2.709}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0417190162.wav", "text": "Hide and seek time. Good luck, Hugh.", "duration": 2.795}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0421604478.wav", "text": "I can't believe Daisy died.", "duration": 2.475}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0427020398.wav", "text": "But still, I don't feel like 8 does. Is that because I'm not as good as she is?", "duration": 8.043}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0439235269.wav", "text": "When dead filament gets on bots, they start acting all weird, right?", "duration": 4.352}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0440255598.wav", "text": "Yeah, okay. Let's go.", "duration": 3.413}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0440342556.wav", "text": "I don't know why, but wearing new clothes is super fun.", "duration": 5.376}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0441843202.wav", "text": "I'm glad all the trees didn't go away.", "duration": 2.432}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0442553986.wav", "text": "Yeah, I thought that was the case.", "duration": 2.176}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0443784048.wav", "text": "Wait, just a few seconds.", "duration": 2.155}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0453005673.wav", "text": "That big lunadigger came right for the platform we were on.", "duration": 3.307}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0459660410.wav", "text": "Really? That's boring.", "duration": 2.688}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0466615926.wav", "text": "I don't know, but I can try learning.", "duration": 2.88}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0468317238.wav", "text": "That bot was gigantic! I didn't know they made them that big!", "duration": 4.459}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0471055782.wav", "text": "I won't queue. Thanks.", "duration": 2.667}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0473892725.wav", "text": "On humans, it'd wipe out the whole infected area, not just the dead filament.", "duration": 5.376}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0483412760.wav", "text": "Even big bots don't stand a chance when we work together.", "duration": 3.605}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0485376212.wav", "text": "Phew! I have a surprise for you.", "duration": 2.667}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0487256210.wav", "text": "Hey, now that the power's back on, we can take the tram somewhere new.", "duration": 3.861}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0487479684.wav", "text": "I don't know, but I think Edith made that one.", "duration": 2.987}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0493473138.wav", "text": "You! Tell me a story!", "duration": 2.219}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0507479877.wav", "text": "Maybe we'll learn more if we read all of it.", "duration": 2.283}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0508002162.wav", "text": "Hey, isn't this a Reed Earth memory?", "duration": 2.581}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0513675734.wav", "text": "What happens if the nutrients aren't enough?", "duration": 2.368}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0517804774.wav", "text": "I want to try on lots of outfits too!", "duration": 2.048}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0526932679.wav", "text": "Did you know animal bots can function on the moon just like me?", "duration": 3.2}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0532098880.wav", "text": "I won't. Let's go stop eight.", "duration": 2.453}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0536097896.wav", "text": "And there was no one else to talk to either.", "duration": 3.776}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0536834666.wav", "text": "Hugh, are you okay?", "duration": 2.325}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0537430282.wav", "text": "I know! I'm so happy!", "duration": 2.219}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0538957238.wav", "text": "It won't, because I don't have to carry anything.", "duration": 2.155}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0542574636.wav", "text": "The pterodome would be so empty without them.", "duration": 2.731}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0551351600.wav", "text": "Space storms mess with signals all the time, so your guess was pretty good.", "duration": 4.928}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0567547904.wav", "text": "But for bots, the dead filament just kind of sticks to them.", "duration": 3.243}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0568150657.wav", "text": "Well, I've got you to talk to, so I'll probably be fine.", "duration": 4.608}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0568425068.wav", "text": "I feel like we went everywhere.", "duration": 2.027}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0578352389.wav", "text": "The replicator bridges are so cool!", "duration": 4.608}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0578570735.wav", "text": "Those bots just kept on coming. I thought they'd never end.", "duration": 4.48}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0581802666.wav", "text": "I'll just be over here. Hmm. By myself.", "duration": 3.669}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0583294749.wav", "text": "Okay. Thanks, Hugh.", "duration": 2.155}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0589016266.wav", "text": "I can't believe Ape made Edus attack all the people at the cradle.", "duration": 4.203}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0589803231.wav", "text": "And now I'll never see him again.", "duration": 2.133}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0590106975.wav", "text": "Yeah, he was always talking about Daisy.", "duration": 4.352}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0591737504.wav", "text": "So, I'm giving it to you.", "duration": 2.219}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0604825907.wav", "text": "That was fun. Let's play again sometime.", "duration": 2.752}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0606930368.wav", "text": "Didn't expect such a big bot to get in our way.", "duration": 3.008}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0609368626.wav", "text": "That tree was so big. Guess that's why the lift wouldn't work.", "duration": 5.483}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0612063500.wav", "text": "Yeah, it feels off somehow.", "duration": 3.051}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0615207456.wav", "text": "Fine.", "duration": 2.155}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0616374521.wav", "text": "I don't know. Maybe they just didn't need me anymore.", "duration": 4.139}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0620241559.wav", "text": "Neat! All I really need to function is a power source.", "duration": 3.989}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0622380874.wav", "text": "Hmm, I can't really find the words, but...", "duration": 3.093}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0624231024.wav", "text": "Look at all the suits here. They look just like yours.", "duration": 4.203}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0632664829.wav", "text": "Eight and I were made to help her get better.", "duration": 2.859}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0648752624.wav", "text": "Ew, come on. Try harder next time.", "duration": 3.755}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0650015134.wav", "text": "Hugh, thanks for everything.", "duration": 2.581}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0651575400.wav", "text": "Do you think she'll get better if we get rid of it all?", "duration": 3.264}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0657120845.wav", "text": "Yeah, I guess that makes sense.", "duration": 2.325}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0659205470.wav", "text": "What was that black stuff?", "duration": 2.197}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0660654025.wav", "text": "Hmm, especially if you forget something.", "duration": 2.944}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0664602399.wav", "text": "Can I come too? I've never met a scruffy little mutt before.", "duration": 4.629}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0677287247.wav", "text": "You're more than that. Um...", "duration": 2.667}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0683136659.wav", "text": "Now that the power's back on, we can probably go see more areas.", "duration": 3.733}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0692621654.wav", "text": "Hugh, you're a really good person.", "duration": 4.203}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0694821702.wav", "text": "You! Over here!", "duration": 2.197}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0700150845.wav", "text": "Smart? What's that supposed to mean? I don't have any special add-ons installed.", "duration": 6.016}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0700381205.wav", "text": "So, what's an amusement park?", "duration": 2.944}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0702728420.wav", "text": "That bot was big, but still really fast.", "duration": 3.563}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0710666550.wav", "text": "and DI-03367, a state-of-the-art pragmatic created here at The Cradle.", "duration": 5.483}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0718277996.wav", "text": "Did you see that bot's face? It opened.", "duration": 3.2}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0718909857.wav", "text": "It's so fun talking to you, Hugh.", "duration": 2.475}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0723193944.wav", "text": "Just like he never saw her again.", "duration": 2.261}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0723324958.wav", "text": "That big bot was in our way, so I don't think so.", "duration": 3.328}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0727010126.wav", "text": "What? Really?", "duration": 2.048}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0730252658.wav", "text": "This time, I'm going to be the one doing the saving.", "duration": 2.752}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0731850454.wav", "text": "Hey, when people go away, it's sad, right?", "duration": 5.163}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0739896048.wav", "text": "Hey, can I give you something?", "duration": 2.069}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0747467010.wav", "text": "Hee hee hee hee hee hee Ha ha Hee hee hee hee", "duration": 3.755}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0749201808.wav", "text": "Phew, that was a lot of container moving.", "duration": 3.349}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0763394651.wav", "text": "It's bots always have messed up designs and serial numbers.", "duration": 3.776}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0782413112.wav", "text": "Um, well, I'm a state-of-the-art pragmata that Edus can't control.", "duration": 4.608}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0788265801.wav", "text": "Whoa! It's a SimPod! Let's try it out!", "duration": 4.331}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0789412261.wav", "text": "I'll hide first. Come and find me.", "duration": 2.475}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0793270512.wav", "text": "I couldn't believe my eyes. The sparkling water. The gentle breeze.", "duration": 5.845}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0794063691.wav", "text": "I'm a hide-and-seek master!", "duration": 2.005}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0794600952.wav", "text": "Okay. I can't wait!", "duration": 2.069}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0804166716.wav", "text": "Really? Everything?", "duration": 2.091}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0804278813.wav", "text": "So, are you still sad that Nicholas is gone?", "duration": 3.477}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0808745570.wav", "text": "They spent all day mining Lunum.", "duration": 2.325}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0811363664.wav", "text": "All clear. No bots in sight.", "duration": 2.368}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0816617045.wav", "text": "Huh? Are we done playing?", "duration": 2.901}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0817578015.wav", "text": "I know, but there should be.", "duration": 2.581}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0819720590.wav", "text": "Hugh, I've got a surprise. You're gonna love it.", "duration": 4.331}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0821448515.wav", "text": "I'm not really sure, but it says the owner of the data is unknown.", "duration": 5.333}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0829802115.wav", "text": "Whoa, this is so cool!", "duration": 2.389}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0837826126.wav", "text": "We're both pragmata, so there's got to be a way to get along, right?", "duration": 4.992}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0848375497.wav", "text": "Really? But you know so much about it, though.", "duration": 3.456}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0855441651.wav", "text": "But those bots are pretty much everywhere, so...", "duration": 3.648}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0857442539.wav", "text": "Hugh, you said later, right? Is now a good time?", "duration": 4.139}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0858266568.wav", "text": "I think it's the dead filament's fault.", "duration": 2.517}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0863752917.wav", "text": "I love it when we can bring stuff back with us.", "duration": 2.688}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0865288266.wav", "text": "They're really nice. They call me Little One.", "duration": 3.371}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0866881578.wav", "text": "Yay! We got all the beacons now!", "duration": 2.112}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0879710203.wav", "text": "Phew! We rebooted both the Regulators!", "duration": 2.88}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0882432993.wav", "text": "It was easy. I was in sleep mode.", "duration": 2.24}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0887914392.wav", "text": "You're not feeling sick from the gravity shifts?", "duration": 2.283}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0891919927.wav", "text": "Hey, look! This terminal has bot data saved in it.", "duration": 3.499}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0894092220.wav", "text": "And if a body gets hurt too bad, it'll die, right?", "duration": 3.008}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0894790307.wav", "text": "Even if I tried really hard, it won't work.", "duration": 3.499}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0904548809.wav", "text": "I want to stop her, but I can't believe she's acting this way.", "duration": 5.355}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0910131561.wav", "text": "Back here again. Safe and snug.", "duration": 2.624}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0914903437.wav", "text": "I don't know. How about you?", "duration": 2.219}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0918743614.wav", "text": "And the test worked, but that just got her killed.", "duration": 3.819}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0919286301.wav", "text": "Thank you. Thanks for talking to me all the time.", "duration": 3.477}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0928503030.wav", "text": "Maybe someone who didn't work at the Cradle saved it here.", "duration": 2.923}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0929906583.wav", "text": "We're not making good progress, but we got to stop eight.", "duration": 3.264}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0930105866.wav", "text": "Maybe if I did have a friend, I wouldn't have ended up in the vault.", "duration": 3.563}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0937294299.wav", "text": "I don't get tired. Are you getting sleepy?", "duration": 2.965}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0938778559.wav", "text": "Let's talk a bunch while we have the chance.", "duration": 2.24}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0942890338.wav", "text": "Let's get lots of REMs and decorate the shelter.", "duration": 3.307}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0942922497.wav", "text": "You said that I need to be more careful, and that I should try not to get hurt.", "duration": 4.288}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0944513685.wav", "text": "Ugh, what's taking so long?", "duration": 2.368}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0953757862.wav", "text": "REMs are pretty weird, don't you think?", "duration": 2.773}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0971189411.wav", "text": "So if we're together, you will keep me safe?", "duration": 4.224}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0974042538.wav", "text": "Q, do you have any children?", "duration": 2.539}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0978468949.wav", "text": "If we reboot one more limb regulator, the tree will disappear!", "duration": 3.669}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0982854827.wav", "text": "We'll stop Edus and rescue it no matter what.", "duration": 2.816}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0982952072.wav", "text": "That big round bot from before was pretty tough.", "duration": 2.795}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0984375867.wav", "text": "The sea was so pretty.", "duration": 2.389}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0986022368.wav", "text": "I get we were made differently. Our bodies, our materials, our functions.", "duration": 5.931}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0990275475.wav", "text": "Not many, because I'm specially made.", "duration": 2.091}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0990801169.wav", "text": "Hmm. Yeah.", "duration": 2.304}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0992269535.wav", "text": "I can learn things, but I won't get taller.", "duration": 3.221}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0999410759.wav", "text": "That's why I'm glad I found you so quickly.", "duration": 2.261}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1001611847.wav", "text": "It's going to go great next time.", "duration": 2.219}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1003788059.wav", "text": "Maybe she got this way because of all the built-up sadness in the dead filament.", "duration": 4.437}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1004634916.wav", "text": "Did you see, Hugh? There are birds!", "duration": 2.603}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1012764272.wav", "text": "Huh? Like, a prediction? I make those all the time.", "duration": 5.163}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1022966554.wav", "text": "Oh, Luna Dickers have been helping out at the cradle for ages.", "duration": 4.139}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1032619737.wav", "text": "I see. In that case, I'll keep playing in the shelter then.", "duration": 4.736}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1036259640.wav", "text": "Hugh, I was really sad when I found out what happened to the doctor.", "duration": 6.827}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1041756808.wav", "text": "Wouldn't it be fun if there were replicator bridges everywhere?", "duration": 3.392}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1048798849.wav", "text": "But, Q, can we try climbing the tree before it's gone?", "duration": 4.011}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1054373245.wav", "text": "Look what I have.", "duration": 3.093}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1059249691.wav", "text": "Now with Eda's acting all weird, they probably got moved inside.", "duration": 3.584}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1059638825.wav", "text": "We can stay here for a while, right?", "duration": 2.133}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1061989499.wav", "text": "Hmm. I think they're supposed to work outside.", "duration": 3.669}
{"audio": "/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1072892802.wav", "text": "Wow, Hugh, you're so good at this.", "duration": 2.773}
